hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"41","سُبْـحانَ رَبِّـيَ الأَعْلـى. (ثلاث مرات)","","","","","Settling a debt"
"42","سُبْـحانَكَ اللّهُـمَّ رَبَّـنا وَبِحَـمْدِكَ ، اللّهُـمَّ اغْفِرْ لي","","","","","For one afflicted by whisperings in prayer or recitation"
